### Generate 10 Vibration Motor parts

### 1. Add Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max Taptic Engine (Phone)
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

